    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6747" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">carbuncŭlo</span></b> ,
		āre, v. n.
		carbunculus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to have a</i> carbunculus. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Of men, <i><span class="en">Plin. 24,
				13, 69, § 113</span></i>; <i><span class="en">23, 3, 34, §
			70</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Of
			plants, <i><span class="en">Plin. 18, 28, 68, § 272</span></i>; <i><span class="en">10, 7, 14, §
			27</span></i>; and in a <i>dep.</i> form, <i><span class="en">id. 14, 2,
				4, § 33</span></i>.</div>
